# Frontend Rules — Next.js 15+ / Tailwind CSS 4

## Stack

- Next.js 15+ (App Router)
- React 19, TypeScript 5
- Tailwind CSS 4
- TanStack Query (data fetching)
- Recharts (charts)
- KaTeX (math rendering)
- lightweight-charts (candlestick/price)

## TypeScript Hard Rules

- `strict: true` in `tsconfig.json` — never disable.
- Use generated Supabase types from `web/src/lib/supabase/database.types.ts`. **Never** hand-write DB row interfaces.
- All `fetch` calls typed with explicit return types.
- No `any` without explicit `// eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any`.

## Design System — Swiss Monochrome

| Token | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Background (Terminal) | `#000000` |
| Background (Shell) | `#ffffff` |
| Text primary | `#ffffff` (dark) / `#000000` (light) |
| Text secondary | `#6b7280` |
| Border | `1px solid #1e293b` (dark) / `#e5e7eb` (light) |
| EUR/USD accent | `#4da6ff` |
| USD/JPY accent | `#ff9944` |
| USD/INR accent | `#e74c3c` |

- **No soft shadows**. No `shadow-lg`, `shadow-md`, etc.
- **No rounded corners**. No `rounded`, `rounded-lg`, `rounded-xl`.
- **No decorative animations**. Functional transitions only (e.g., hover states, data updates).
- All financial numbers use `tabular-nums`.
- Font: JetBrains Mono for numeric values, Inter or system sans for body.

## Component Conventions

- Prefer server components. Use `'use client'` only when:
  - Interactivity (hooks, event handlers) is required
  - Browser APIs (localStorage, WebSocket) are needed
  - TanStack Query `useQuery` is used
- Co-locate components with their pages when page-specific.
- Shared UI primitives go in `web/src/components/ui/`.
- All chart components in `web/src/components/charts/`.

## Data Fetching

- Server components: `fetch` with `revalidate` or `cache: 'force-cache'`.
- Client components: TanStack Query `useQuery` / `useSuspenseQuery`.
- Supabase client: use `createServerClient` (server) or `createBrowserClient` (client).
- Never expose `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` to the frontend.

## Routing

- App Router only. No `pages/` directory.
- Route groups for layout segregation: `(shell)/`, `(terminal)/`.
- Dynamic routes: `[slug]/` not `[...slug]` unless explicitly needed.

## Anti-Patterns

- Do NOT add new pairs to the UI (3-pair lock).
- Do NOT use `fetch` inside `useEffect` — use TanStack Query.
- Do NOT import Node.js modules into client components.
- Do NOT add CSS-in-JS libraries (styled-components, emotion). Tailwind only.
